 "name": "Fang Versatility",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/eight-heads.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Fangs of Orochi</em></p>\n<p>You have trained your technique to be more versatile in combat. You can wield <em>Fangs or Orochi</em> as a Dagger or Shortsword. On a hit with this weapon, a creature must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failure, the creature takes an additional 2d6 poison damage and is poisoned until the end of their next turn. Your Fang Shikigami gain the following improvements:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>The AC of your Fangs becomes 15 + your proficiency bonus.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Your Fangs deal an additional 2d4 poison damage on a hit.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
